SECTION 2 (new): It shall be unlawful for any person to carry or possesses an electric gun in or near an airport, passenger transportation terminal, commuter operations area, state or county government building, or any meeting place required to be open to the public pursuant to chapter 92; provided that the following shall be exempt:
SECTION 2 (new): (2) A full time paid peace officer of another state or the federal government who is carrying out official duties while in the State or any person summoned by the peace officer to assist in making arrests or preserving the peace while that person is engaged in assisting the peace officer;
SECTION 2 (new): Any person violating this section shall be guilty of a misdemeanor.
